<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>RNA Analyzer</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>RNA Analyzer</h1>
</header>

<main>
    <form action="../cgi-bin/webserver_AA.cgi" method="post">
        <section>
            <p>With this web interface, you can search your RNA/DNA for several known RNA structures and retrieve some general information about your sequence.</p>
            <p>Please choose your options below!</p>
        </section>

        <hr>

        <section>
            <label for="seqname">Name your sequence (optional)</label>
            <input type="text" name="SEQNAME" id="seqname" size="30">
        </section>

        <section>
            <label for="fasta">If several FASTA-sequences are provided, please check the box</label>
            <input type="checkbox" name="FASTA" id="fasta" value="ON"> 
            <a target="_blank" href="SEQUENCEinfo.html">Click here to get more information on this feature</a>
        </section>

        <section>
            <label for="origin"><a target="_blank" href="SEQUENCEinfo.html">SEQUENCE</a></label>
            <input type="checkbox" name="ORIGIN" id="origin" value="ON" checked> Sequence is RNA
        </section>

        <section>
            <textarea rows="10" name="SEQUENCE" cols="64" placeholder="Enter your sequence here..."></textarea>
        </section>

        <section>
            <input type="submit" value="Submit" name="START">
            <input type="reset" value="Reset" name="RESET">
        </section>

        <hr>

        <section>
            <p>Special features:</p>
            <input type="checkbox" name="IRE" value="ON" checked>
            <a target="_blank" href="IREinfo.htm">IRE</a>
            <input type="checkbox" name="TRANS" value="ON" checked>
            <a target="_blank" href="TRANSinfo.html">Trans-splicing structure</a>
        </section>
    </form>

    <p><a target="_blank" href="examples.html">Examples to test</a></p>
    <p>If you need more information or if RNAAnalyzer was useful for you, you might have a look at / cite:</p>
    <p>Peter Bengert and Thomas Dandekar<br> 
    A software tool-box for analysis of regulatory RNA elements<br> 
    Nucl. Acids. Res. 2003 31: 3441-3445.</p>
    <p>The RNAAnalyzer has temporarily been down due to migration problems. This should be fixed now.</p> 
</main>

</body>
</html>
